  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Having an improved ability to preview items in the VRC shop, such as portals, emojis, warp effects, and other playable objects would be great. Currently the only way to view this is by previewing the item in the VRC UI, which may behave completely different to what users think. Something similar to how avatars previews work in the avatar shop, would improve this experience.\n\nHow it could work is by previewing it in the shop, users can select an object or effect to spawn only for them. Items spawned can be grabbed and interacted with all effects only seen by the user, emojis and stickers can be temporarily used but are only shown by the user, and stationary items such as portals and warp effects can be placed in a single area, where the effects will loop until the user ends the preview.\n\nSo the too long didn’t read version: have item previews in the VRC shop act like avatar previews, where items can only be seen by the user and no one else so the user can properly understand what they are purchasing.",
